## Pricing data

The built-in USD token price catalog is derived from the public
[LiteLLM price file](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BerriAI/litellm/main/model_prices_and_context_window.json)
and the models.dev public API. Snapshot time, source SHA-256 and the exact
provider/model entries retained are recorded in `src/m1/prices.json`;
`docs/m1/PRICING-SYNC-20261004.md` documents the sync contract. Only explicit USD
token prices are extracted; missing cache prices are never inferred and model
aliases are never fuzzy-matched.

